> Show every fixed-seed sample without filtering

All24 source samples are shown. The component selection is a stochastic mixture
choice, not argmax. Red, green and blue draws share that chosen component;
green and blue use the already quantized channels of their own current pixel.
The same full uniform bank, component IDs, saved parameters and images reproduce
bit identically on repeated sampling. This small run produces noisy low-resolution
colors; lower NLL does not establish recognizable objects or perceptual quality.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/pp_samples.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
